  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 55(b)(1), the tentative minimum tax applies 26% to the first $232,600 of AMTI above the exemption and 28% to the excess. Calculation: (26% x $232,600) + (28% x $17,400) = $60,476 + $4,872 = $65,348. The two-bracket structure produces a precise result.
